{"id":"devyanosto","lemma":"девяносто","pos":"num","rank":4739,"glosses":["ninety (90)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/eb/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%B2%D1%8F%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%B2%D1%8F%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Моему деду девяносто лет.","en":"My grandad is 90 years old.","words":[{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"grandfather","l":"дед"},null,{"g":"year","l":"год"}]},{"text":"Тому было хорошо за девяносто, когда он умер.","en":"Tom was well over ninety when he died.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"well, right"},{"g":"behind / for"},null,{"g":"when"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"}]},{"text":"Том умер в девяносто семь лет.","en":"Tom died when he was 97.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"seven"},{"g":"year","l":"год"}]},{"text":"Прочтите, пожалуйста, страницу девяносто четыре.","en":"Please read page ninety-four.","words":[{"g":"to finish reading","l":"прочесть"},{"g":"please"},null,null,{"g":"four"}]},{"text":"Том сделал девяносто процентов работы.","en":"Tom did 90% of the work.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},null,null,{"g":"work","l":"работа"}]}]}